    "Events are switched off, and the game is making no network call. Options carries the notice that switches them on, and the game is whole either way.": "事件已关闭，游戏不会进行网络通信。“选项”中有开启事件的提示；无论开关如何，游戏都能完整运行。",
    "<p class=\"watchready\">An hour of yours stands unaccepted. The Guild pays it, closed muster or no.</p>": "<p class=\"watchready\">你有一小时的值守尚未被接纳。无论集会是否关闭，行会都会支付这段时间。</p>",
    "<p class=\"mustershout\" style=\"margin-top:6px;\">The Guild asks what this meant</p>": "<p class=\"mustershout\" style=\"margin-top:6px;\">行会询问这意味着什么</p>",
    "<div class=\"besthead\">The book of benefactors</div>": "<div class=\"besthead\">捐助者名册</div>",
