    "<div class=\"ach locked\"><b>· A fresh page</b><span class=\"prov\">The book lies open in the Guildhouse hall, and the pen is kept full.</span></div>": "<div class=\"ach locked\"><b>· 新的一页</b><span class=\"prov\">名册摊开在行会大厅，笔中始终装满墨水。</span></div>",
    "<div class=\"musterplate todo\"><span>a plate is to be hung here</span></div>": "<div class=\"musterplate todo\"><span>此处将悬挂一块插图</span></div>",
