    "<div class='ci-ill'>An oath already stands, and the Guild allows one to a chronicle.</div>": "<div class='ci-ill'>已有一道誓言生效，而行会允许每份编年史拥有一道誓言。</div>",
    "Firing odds stop at 80% however high this figure runs; the workbook states each working's own.": "无论数值多高，施法概率最高只能达到 80%；工作簿会说明每个法术自身的概率。",
    "Twice the hammer falls, and the work holds twice. The smith turns the piece over and looks at it a long while.": "铁锤落下两次，工程也承受两次。铁匠翻转物品，久久端详。",
