(function () {
  const extra3 = {
    "The Maw-boar drives onto your spear to the crossbar and bears you back a full pace before its legs fail, and the great head comes down at last across the mouth of the den it has held so long.": "巨口野猪撞上你的长矛，直到矛杆横挡在前；它的双腿终于失力，巨大的头颅轰然落下，横在它守护已久的巢穴入口。",
    "Old Snik falls among his stolen bones with a spear yet in either fist, and upon the trophy wall behind the throne the last empty nail is his.": "老斯尼克倒在盗来的骨骸之间，双拳仍各握一柄长矛；王座后的战利品墙上，最后一枚空钉如今属于他。",
    "The Forewarden's dead grip loosens upon the door he was set to hold, and he sinks down against it, his long watch run out at the very post that was given him.": "前任守门人的亡手在奉命守护的门上松开，他靠着门沉下去；漫长的值守终于在授予他的岗位上走到尽头。",
    "The cold signet slips from the Reeve's hand and rings once upon the flagstones, and the dead of three galleries lie back down in their proper rows as their marshal is unseated.": "冰冷印戒从镇长手中滑落，在石板上响了一声；三座长廊中的亡者重新躺回各自的行列，他们的统帅已被掀下座位。",
    "The Celebrant sinks back beneath the flood with his crook crossed upon his breast, and the sunken office passes to the water that has waited under the altar to receive it.": "司祭将牧杖交叉放在胸前，沉回洪水之下；沉没的职司归还给一直在祭坛下等待接收它的水。",
    "Malgrith comes down out of the vault air in a long ruin of wing and flame, and the hoard rings beneath the wyrm like a struck bell as the great red terror of Lowmoor is stilled at last.": "马尔格里斯从宝库空气中俯冲而下，化作漫长的翅翼与火焰残骸；巨龙下方的宝藏如被敲响的钟般鸣动，Lowmoor 的赤红恐怖终于归于寂静。",
    "The Porter takes the gate's whole weight upon its shoulders a final time, and stone and doorkeeper come down together across the threshold they have kept since the elder stair was first cut.": "搬运工最后一次用双肩承受大门的全部重量；石门与守门人一同越过自古老阶梯开凿以来便守护的门槛，轰然倒下。",
    "Gnasha reaches for the crown upon the throne-post as she falls and comes up short of it, and the stone she ruled by goes quiet in the deep below her.": "格纳莎倒下时伸手去够王座柱上的王冠，却差之毫厘；她曾凭以统治的石头在身下深渊归于寂静。",
    "The Tarn-Mother sinks back into her black water in a slow fall of foam, and the shallows she has kept since before the dwarves' first lamp lie flat and dark as before.": "山间湖之母在缓慢翻涌的泡沫中沉回黑水；自矮人点亮第一盏灯之前便由她守护的浅滩，重新平静而昏暗。",
    "The Under-Gardener settles among its own beds and puts down one last root where it stands, and a hundred years of tending come to rest in the soil that it tended.": "地下园丁安坐在自己的苗床之间，在立足处种下最后一根根须；一百年的照料终于在它照料过的土壤中安息。",
    "The Procurer closes his ledger upon its ribbon a final time and sets down the little grey bell, and the accounts owed to the stone below stand forever unsettled.": "采购官最后一次用丝带合上账簿，放下那枚小小的灰钟；欠下方石头的账目永远无法结清。",
    "The Speaker sinks beneath the black water with its last word half-shaped upon the flood, and the shard-field falls out of its single pitch into common silence.": "发声者带着尚未成形的最后一句话沉入黑水；碎片原野脱离单一音高，坠入寻常的寂静。",
    "The False Guildmaster folds down over its counterfeit counter as the fair wax face runs, and the roll of stolen names slips from its jointed reach to lie open at your feet.": "赝品行会会长在赝品柜台上折叠下去，端正的蜡脸开始融化；被盗姓名的名册从关节肢臂间滑落，在你脚边摊开。",
    "The Keeper sets down its brass whistle and follows the pail to the floor, and the open cages keep their long rows in silence, their keeper fallen among them.": "看守者放下黄铜哨子，跟随水桶倒在地面；敞开的笼舍仍沉默地排列，而它的看守倒在其中。",
    "The Copyist-General sinks against his lectern with the account of your descent open before him, and every lifted pen in the scriptorium comes down in the same instant and is still.": "抄写总管靠着讲台沉下去，你的下行记录仍在他面前摊开；缮写室里每一支悬起的笔同时落下，归于静止。",
    "The Fairest Copy falls with your own stance and the master's eyes, and down the whole length of the gallery your reflection returns to the glass that it stepped from.": "最完美的副本随着你的姿态和主人的目光倒下；沿整条长廊，你的倒影回到它走出的玻璃之中。",
    "The First Apprentice goes back into the melt it climbed from, and the fresh metal runs off it into the channels, and the works stand cold over their first pouring.": "第一学徒回到它爬出的熔液中，新鲜金属从它身上流入沟槽；工程立在第一次浇注之上，冷却无声。",
    "The last of Vastian bows once more, correctly, and comes down beneath the turning rings, and his copies wink out along the halls one upon another until a single mage lies below the eyepiece.": "最后一个瓦斯蒂安再次正确行礼，走到旋转环下方；他的副本沿大厅一个接一个熄灭，直到目镜下只剩一名法师。",
    "The empty livery of the Usher settles across the servants' door it kept, the black rod slipping from a sleeve that never held a hand, and the office of the door is ended where no court remains to keep the door for.": "引导员的空制服覆盖在它守护的仆役门上；黑色短杖从从未握过手的袖中滑落，而守门职司也在不再存在的宫廷处终结。",
    "The Under-Registrar sinks against the enrolling-desk with the pen still in its grip, and down the whole length of the stacks the chained volumes fall shut one upon another, the manifest of the sealed taking no further entry from its hand.": "地下登记官靠着登记桌沉下去，手中仍握着笔；沿整排书架，锁链拴住的卷册接连合拢，封印清单不再接受它的任何记录。",
    "The First Warden lies back into the plain tomb at the gallery's head with its hands returning to the seal it was carved upon, and the six tombs behind it grow still, their tenants attending the eldest into rest.": "第一守门人躺回长廊尽头朴素的坟墓，双手回到刻有封印的位置；身后六座坟墓也归于寂静，墓中住客陪伴长者安息。",
    "The Remembrancer closes its ledger upon the last open account, and the little iron bell falls from its hand and rings once upon the flags, and the debtors of the deep lie down in their broken cells with their terms uncalled at last.": "记忆保管人合上最后一笔未结账目的账簿，小铁钟从手中落下，在石板上响了一声；深渊的债务人终于躺回破碎牢室，再无人呼唤他们履行期限。",
    "The Turnkey of the Works comes down across the beam it tended, and the counterweight runs to the foot of its arc and hangs there, and the drum that kept the count in sevens since the first stair beats its last and is silent.": "工程转钥人沿它照料的横梁倒下，配重滑到弧线底部悬在那里；自第一道阶梯以来以七计数的鼓敲出最后一声，归于寂静。",
    "The Lich does not withdraw as he has withdrawn every season, for there is no season after this one; he sinks against his own desk with the blank first page of the new Roll beneath his hand, tells you while he can where the pen is charged and how the fire is laid, in the manner of a warden handing on a post, and the last honest keeper of the count is still, and the count is left off at his name.": "巫妖没有像每个赛季那样退下，因为此后再无赛季；他靠着自己的书桌沉下去，手下压着新名册的空白首页。在还能开口时，他像守门人交接岗位那样告诉你笔在哪里装墨、火如何铺设；最后一位诚实的计数保管者静止了，计数也停在他的名字上。",
    "The First Claimant sinks back over the sill it was never let across, and the last door stands open at your back and before you both, the threshold no warden crossed living crossed at last.": "第一索债者沉回从未被允许越过的门槛；最后一道门在你身后和你面前同时敞开，那道没有守门人活着越过的门槛终于被越过。",
    "The Under-Mason settles into the course it was cutting and the black water closes over it, and the raising of the Maw from below is stopped where the two diggings meet.": "地下石匠沉入正在开凿的沟槽，黑水在其上合拢；从下方抬升巨口深渊的工程，在两处挖掘相遇之处停止。",
    "The Unwritten sinks into the blank stone that keeps no print of it, and the floor lies featureless behind you, keeping no record that it rose or that you crossed.": "无字者沉入不留下任何痕迹的空白石头；楼层在你身后保持无特征，不记录它曾升起，也不记录你曾穿过。",
    "The Broken Fetter falls slack among the links it parted, and the great chain lies quiet across the deep, seven signatures at seven anchors and every bond of them drawn open.": "断裂镣铐在它拆开的链环间松垂；巨链横卧深渊归于寂静，七个锚点上的七个签名与每一道锁结都已被拉开。",
    "The Teller of Sevens lies back into the bedrock it has counted since before Mereward, and the ground stirs and settles, breathing, the bright new mark standing at the end of the last seven.": "七数计数者躺回自梅里沃德之前便开始计数的基岩；地面呼吸般起伏后沉静，明亮的新痕立在最后一组七数的末端。",
    "Vhorren comes down out of the deep air in a long fall of coin and glow, the debt the deep was dug to bury met at the bottom of the world, and the whole first hoard rings beneath it like a struck bell as the count is called at last.": "沃伦从深渊空气中伴随金币与微光长长坠落；深渊被挖来埋葬的债务在世界底部得到清偿，第一堆宝藏在它下方如被敲响的钟般鸣动，计数终于宣告完成。",
    "The season's keeper stands down at the last chair, and the tail of the module composes itself for the season between.": "本季的保管人从最后一把椅子前退下，模块的尾声为夹在其中的赛季自行编排。"
  };
  globalThis.LOWMOOR_ZH_EXACT = Object.assign(globalThis.LOWMOOR_ZH_EXACT || {}, extra3);
})();

