    "A nineteen, counted for a twenty upon your papers": "掷出 19，在你的档案上按 20 计算", "It is kept upon the Roll, and it outlives the chronicle that fed it.": "它会保留在名册上，并活得比孕育它的编年史更久。", "It is your trade's own, and it deepens as you do.": "它属于你的职业，并会随着你的成长而加深。", "Won at the Guild forge, off the roll of the work itself, and once ever.": "从行会熔炉的工程名册中赢得，每份编年史只能获得一次。", "The full Chronicle runs on well past where this demo ends.": "完整的编年史会远远超出本演示的范围。", "Chapters cleared": "已通关章节", "Floors cleared": "已通关楼层", "Quests completed": "已完成任务", "Rank at the shard-field": "碎片原野的阶位", "Rank at the observatory": "天文台的阶位", "Just the exercise, thanks": "只是练习，谢谢。", "Whatever's in the cloth": "布里的东西",
    "Taking the stair down": "沿阶梯下行", "Following the wall through the dark": "沿墙穿过黑暗", "Picking a way over the fallen stone": "在坍塌石块上找路", "Crossing the gallery": "穿过长廊", "Sounding the floor ahead": "探测前方地面", "A long stretch of it: {place}, and the lamp finds floor ahead and floor behind.": "一长段路程：{place}；灯光照出前方与后方的地面。", "You work the length of {place}, sounding the floor as you go, and it holds.": "你走过 {place} 全程，一路探测地面；地面承受住了。", "{place}, and the only thing moving in it is the lamp in your own hand.": "{place}；其中唯一移动的是你手中的灯。", "You put a good stretch of {place} behind you, and the dark closes over it again.": "你把 {place} 的一大段甩在身后，黑暗再次将它合拢。", "The passage runs on through {place}, and you walk it out to the end.": "通道穿过 {place} 延伸，你一路走到尽头。", "You take {place} at a steady pace, and the walls stand where the chart says they stand.": "你以稳定步速穿过 {place}，墙壁正如地图所标。", "You sleep hard, and wake with nothing kept of it past the first cold breath of the morning.": "你沉沉睡去，醒来时除了清晨第一口寒气，什么也没有留下。", "Something walks through the night's sleep and leaves behind it only the shape of having been there.": "有什么东西穿过夜间睡眠，只留下曾经来过的形状。", "The dark has nothing to show you tonight, and the fire is grey ash by the time you stand up out of it.": "今晚黑暗没有任何东西要展示；你起身时，火焰已经化作灰烬。", "You dream of the surface, of a doorway and a street with rain in it, and you wake in the dark with the smell of it on you.": "你梦见地表、一道门和一条落着雨的街；在黑暗中醒来时，那气味仍留在身上。"
