    "{name} the tinker-adept writes the descent up as a monograph on the drawing of wells, and the Guild school buys three copies for its shelf.": "巧匠学徒 {name} 把此次下行写成一部关于汲取法力之井的专著，行会学校买下三册收入书架。",
    "{name} the failed examinee sits the Guild school's test a fourth time with your commendation in hand, and passes it at the top of the list.": "落榜应试者 {name} 带着你的嘉奖信第四次参加行会学校考试，并以榜首成绩通过。",
    "{name} the apothecary's apprentice is examined by the Guild's physicians upon the strength of that case-book, and is licensed to compound for the descents.": "药剂师学徒 {name} 凭那本病例簿接受行会医师考核，取得为下行队伍配制药剂的执照。",
    "{name} the kennel-master is given the whole of the Guild's animal roll to keep, and the paddock above the Maw carries their name inside the year.": "犬舍主管 {name} 受命保管行会完整动物名册；不到一年，巨口深渊上方牧场便以他们的名字命名。",
    "{name} the falconer takes a hooded bird off the Guild's own perch and goes back to the rim to fly it, with your word in the book behind them.": "驯鹰人 {name} 从行会自己的栖架上取下一只戴头罩的鸟，返回深渊边缘放飞；你的推荐语已经记在他们身后的名册中。"
