    "{name} the pack mule is turned out to the Guild paddock above the Maw, sound of wind and foot, to eat the Guild's oats for the rest of its days.": "驮骡 {name} 被放养在巨口深渊上方的行会牧场，呼吸与四蹄都很健康，此后余生都能享用行会燕麦。",
    "{name} the pit pony is stabled at the rim with the windlass ponies, and Old Hesper feeds it apples from his own hand.": "矿坑矮马 {name} 与绞盘马一起安置在深渊边缘的马厩，老赫斯珀会亲手喂它苹果。",
    "{name} the draught ox is retired to the Guild's surface pasture, where it hauls the hay-wain twice a year and grazes out the rest.": "役牛 {name} 退休后住进行会地表牧场，每年两次负责拖运干草车，其余时间都可自在吃草。",
    "{name} the porter takes the pay and a share of the honour, and signs on with the next party down as a full member, upon your word to the Guild.": "搬运工 {name} 领取报酬与一份荣誉，并凭你向行会作出的推荐，以正式成员身份签入下一支下行队伍。",
    "{name} the pack goat is given to the Guild kitchen-yard, where it keeps the scraps down and the cook in swearing, and carries nothing heavier than its own opinion.": "驮山羊 {name} 被送到行会厨房院落，负责吃掉厨余，也负责让厨师不断咒骂；此后它不用再驮任何比自己意见更沉重的东西。",
    "{name} the barrow-man is set up by the Guild with a cart of their own at the rim, and hauls for the counter now, well paid and above ground.": "行会为推车夫 {name} 在深渊边缘置办了一辆自己的货车。如今他们替柜台运输，报酬优厚，而且始终在地表。",
    "{name} the cart-dog is kept by the Guildhouse porter, sleeps across the counter door, and draws nothing heavier than the children's sledge in the yard.": "拉车犬 {name} 由行会大厅门房收养，横睡在柜台门口，此后拉过最重的东西也只是孩子们在院里的雪橇。",
    "{name} the link-boy is taken onto the Guild's own strength as a runner, with a lantern of their own and a wage entered fair in the book.": "火把童子 {name} 被正式编入行会，担任传令员，有了一盏自己的提灯，工资也端正记入名册。",
    "{name} the lamplighter goes back to the rim to light the Guildhouse lamps at dusk, and tells the descent by name to any who stand them a drink.": "点灯人 {name} 回到深渊边缘，每逢黄昏点亮行会大厅的灯；只要有人请喝一杯，便会逐名讲述这次下行。",
    "{name} the under-guide draws a fair copy of your road for the Guild survey, signs it in the corner, and hires on to the next party the season after.": "地下向导 {name} 为行会勘测队誊清你的路线，在图角签名，并于下一赛季受雇加入另一支队伍。",
    "{name} the dwarf carries the lamp back up to the surface diggings, where the Guild pays them to teach the young miners which draught means run.": "矮人 {name} 把矿灯带回地表矿场，行会付钱请他们教导年轻矿工：哪一种气流意味着必须立刻逃跑。",
    "{name} the cresset-bearer carries the fire back up to the chapel at the rim, sets it in its old iron ring, and keeps it lit for the parties going down.": "火盆手 {name} 把火焰带回深渊边缘的礼拜堂，重新安放在古老铁环中，为每支下行队伍保持燃烧。"
