// Boss phase transitions: below the last door and the Mourning Vale.
(() => {
  const target = globalThis.LOWMOOR_ZH_EXACT || (globalThis.LOWMOOR_ZH_EXACT = {});
  Object.assign(target, {
    "The First Claimant rises where it has stood since the first warden set the watch, the first of the debt to reach the sill and be turned back, and it bars the last door against you as it was barred against the deep. It has waited an age at the sill to be let up, and it will suffer nothing living to pass it going down.": "第一索债者从自第一守门人设岗以来一直站立的地方起身。它是最先抵达门槛又被击退的债务，如今像当年大门阻挡深渊那样，把最后一扇门挡在你面前。它在门槛等待了一个时代，盼望获准上行，因此绝不容许任何活物向下通过。",
    "The Under-Mason lays down its inverted chisel and rises out of the wall it was cutting, and the drowned galleries answer it course upon course, for it raised them all from below. It has worked the Maw upward toward the surface for an age, and it takes you for a flaw in the last course, to be dressed off and worked back into the stone.": "地下石匠放下倒置凿子，从正在开凿的墙中起身；被淹长廊一层层回应它，因为那全是它从下方建起的工程。它用了一个时代让巨口深渊朝地表向上生长，如今把你视作最后一层石工中的瑕疵，要将你修掉，重新砌回石中。",
    "The Unwritten gathers itself out of the blank stone that keeps no mark, the one thing the descent was never charted to hold, entered outward bound in the Roll above with its return column left open. It comes on to take the record off you as the floor takes no record, and to leave your own column open like its.": "未书者从不留痕迹的空白石头中聚成形体；它是下行图表从未记录会容纳之物，在上方名册中登记为离境，归还栏却始终空白。它前来抹去你身上的记录，如同这一层从不保留记录，还要让你的归还栏也像它的一样永远敞开。",
    "The Broken Fetter draws itself up from the parted links, the restraint itself given a will, that opened the great chain ring by ring from the inside across an age. It signs no anchor, for it set no bond; it broke them all, in seven hands' despite, and it means to bind you where the chain would not hold what it was hung to hold.": "断枷从分开的链环中撑起身体；它是束缚本身获得意志，在一个时代中从内侧逐环拉开巨链。它未在任何锚点签名，因为它从不立下束缚，只违逆七双手的意志将其全部打破。如今它要在巨链无法困住所缚之物的地方，反过来束缚你。",
    "The Teller of Sevens rises from the bedrock it has scored in sevens since before Mereward, the keeper of the count the whole descent has heard in drums and tally-marks and stone. It cuts a fresh mark into the old stone as you come, bright at the end of the newest seven, and it means to enter you in the count it has kept of every warden down.": "报七者从基岩中起身；早在梅里沃德建立以前，它便以七为组在石上刻痕，守着整条下行之路从鼓声、计数痕与岩石中听见的计数。你到来时，它在古老石面凿下新痕，明亮地落在最新一组七的末尾；它打算把你也计入历代下行守门人的数字。",
    "The coin of the first hoard heaves and rings and pours away beneath you as Vhorren rises through it, the debt the deep was dug to bury, and the glow you took for gold this far down is the light of it breathing. It has counted every warden down and lain warm under its hoard an age, and it has been waiting, it tells you in a voice felt through the coin and not heard, to be collected.": "沃伦从最初宝藏中升起，脚下钱币翻涌、鸣响、四散倾泻。它正是深渊被挖来埋葬的债务；你一路下行时误认作黄金反光的光芒，其实是它呼吸的亮光。一个时代以来，它数着每位守门人倒下，温热地躺在宝藏下等待。它以一道透过钱币感知而非耳朵听见的声音告诉你：自己一直等着被收取。",
    "Vhorren rises to the roof of the deep and fills it, older than the foundation and older than the debt it is, and the whole hoard rings with the rising like a struck bell. Far above, faint down twenty-nine floors of dark, the Guild windlass turns for the next name upon the roll, and the sound of it reaches even here, and Vhorren pauses at the one thing in the deep that was not counting it. You take the opening the windlass has bought you, and go for the last count.": "沃伦升到深渊顶壁，填满整个空间；它比地基更古老，甚至比自己所代表的债务更古老。整座宝藏随它升起而鸣响，仿佛一口被敲响的大钟。遥远上方，行会绞盘为名册上的下一个名字开始转动，声音穿过二十九层黑暗，甚至传到这里。面对深渊中唯一不曾对它计数的东西，沃伦停顿了；你抓住绞盘为你换来的破绽，向最后一次计数发起攻击。",
    "The hound gives back a length along the parapet, bleeding and in no hurry, and sets itself square across the crown of the bridge, where the planks run narrowest and a man must come on alone.": "猎犬流着血，不慌不忙地沿女墙退开一段，随后横身挡住桥顶。那里木板最窄，只容一人独自前进。",
    "Mother Vell lays her hand flat upon the tally cut into the doorpost and reads the whole length of it aloud, night by night and name by name. The village hears her out from behind its shutters, and what stands up out of that reading is a great deal older than the woman who read it.": "维尔嬷嬷把手掌平贴在门柱计数上，沿全长高声读出，逐夜、逐名。村民隔着窗板听她念完；从诵读中站起来的东西，比读出它的女人古老得多。",
    "The Warden sets the hunting-horn to its lips and blows the long call that gathers the pack, and the thorn answers from every ride at once. Then it lowers the antlers it was given for its service and comes on, and the wood comes on behind it.": "猎场守卫把狩猎号角送到唇边，吹响召集兽群的长音，荆棘从每条林间车道同时回应。随后它低下因服役而受赐的鹿角，迎面冲来，整片树林也跟在身后涌来。",
    "The Abbot closes the register upon the lectern, marks his place with one finger, and steps down out of the grave he was buried standing in. He asked one thing of the Count in life and was refused it, and he means to be heard before he lies down.": "院长合上读经台上的登记册，用一根手指标住页码，从自己被站立埋葬的墓中走下。生前他只向伯爵请求过一件事，却遭到拒绝；再次躺下以前，他决意让人听见这项请求。",
    "The Bride walks the last of the causeway to the place where it stops and steps off the end of it, and the whole lake stands up behind her in one slow lift. The bells that have rung under Ysmere all this while ring out above it now, and they ring a wedding.": "新娘走过堤道最后一段，在道路终止之处迈出边缘；整座湖泊在她身后缓缓升起。长久以来沉在伊斯梅尔湖下的钟声如今响彻水面，而它们敲响的是一场婚礼。",
    "The Master of Hounds puts the brass whistle between his teeth and blows it once, and the thirty-nine open runs answer him in a body. He steps back into the gateway to give his pack the room, and he keeps the gate himself, as he has kept it since his burial.": "猎犬主人把黄铜哨含在齿间吹响一次，三十九间敞开的犬舍齐声回应。他退入门洞，为兽群让出空间，自己守住大门，一如自下葬以来始终所做。",
    "Corvane rises from the head of his own table and sets the glass down unfilled, and every fire in the long hall goes up together with no hand near them. He has kept this house three hundred years against the day somebody walked up the crag to him, and he greets you as a host greets an expected guest.": "科尔瓦恩从自己长桌的首席起身，放下尚未斟满的酒杯；长厅所有炉火在无人触碰的情况下同时升腾。他守着这座宅邸三百年，等待终于有人沿峭壁前来；如今他以主人迎接预期宾客的方式向你致意。",
    "The Count gives ground the whole length of the hall to the chapel door, wedged shut from within these three hundred years, and sets his back against the beam. Behind him the shutters of the crag come open at once, and the mist stands at every window of the house, and the Vale is watching how this is answered.": "伯爵沿整条大厅一路退到礼拜堂门前。那扇门从内侧楔死已有三百年；他背靠横梁站定。身后，峭壁宅邸的窗板同时敞开，雾站在每一扇窗外，整座哀悼谷都在注视这场回答。"
  });
})();

// Boss phase transitions: the False Guildmaster through the Last Vault Lich.
(() => {
  const target = globalThis.LOWMOOR_ZH_EXACT || (globalThis.LOWMOOR_ZH_EXACT = {});
  Object.assign(target, {
    "The False Guildmaster sets down its pen, and the fair face goes the way of the wax it always was. What keeps the counter below is jointed for reach rather than for company, and it has your name in the book already.": "假行会长放下笔，端正面孔融回它本来的蜡质。守在下方柜台后的东西，关节是为了延伸触及而造，并非为了与人相处；它的账簿里早已有你的名字。",
    "The Keeper sets down the pail with great care and puts a brass whistle to what remains of its lips. From the dark of the cage-rows the collection begins to arrive, in the order of the feeding-book.": "看守小心放下提桶，把黄铜哨凑到残存的嘴唇。笼舍长排的黑暗中，藏品开始依照喂养簿次序逐一到来。",
    "The Copyist-General rules a line beneath his page and stands, and every pen in the scriptorium lifts with him. What follows next is written before it happens, and the hall bends itself to keep to the text.": "抄写总管在书页下划线，随后起身；缮写室每一支笔都与他一同抬起。接下来发生的事会在发生以前写下，而整座厅堂都将弯曲自身以服从文本。",
    "The Fairest Copy steps from the glass with your own stance and the master's eyes, and every mirror down the gallery empties itself to watch. It has worn a thousand callers, and it means to keep yours.": "最完美的复制品以你的姿态、大师的双眼走出镜面，长廊每一面镜子都清空自身前来观看。它曾穿戴一千名来访者的形貌，如今打算留下你的。",
    "The First Apprentice takes hold of the crucible chains and rides them down into the melt, and what climbs back out wears the fresh metal like a second issue of itself. The works were built to make its kind, and it knows where everything is kept.": "第一学徒抓住坩埚锁链，随它们降入熔液；重新爬出的东西把新鲜金属穿在身上，如同自己的第二版铸品。工场本就是为了制造其同类而建，它清楚每样东西收在哪里。",
    "Vastian steps back from the eyepiece and bows, correctly, in the Guild's own form. Then he is standing in four places at once, and every one of him is turning back his cuffs for the work.": "瓦斯蒂安从目镜前退开，以完全正确的行会礼仪鞠躬。随后他同时站在四个位置，每一个他都卷起袖口，准备动手。",
    "Far above, faint down seventeen floors of dark, Old Hesper's token rings upon the stone: one small coin of witness, sent down for the floor last won. Every eye in the observatory turns to the sound, for it is the one thing in the halls the master never made himself, and you take the opening it has bought you.": "遥远上方，老赫斯珀的信物撞在石上，声响穿过十七层黑暗微弱传来：一枚见证胜利的小钱币，为刚刚攻克的楼层送下。观测台每只眼睛都转向声音，因为那是厅堂中唯一并非大师亲手制造之物；你抓住它为你换来的破绽。",
    "The Usher stands aside from the servants' door with a bow of exact precedence, and then the livery stands up empty of it and bars the way with the black rod of its office. The office is ended, and what keeps the door now keeps it for no court at all.": "引导员严格依尊卑礼序鞠躬，从仆役门旁让开；随后制服脱离其中的存在自行站起，以职务黑杖封住道路。这项职分已经终结，如今守门之物不再为任何宫廷守门。",
    "The Under-Registrar rules a line beneath the open volume and rises, and every chained book down the stacks falls open at the name it keeps. What comes about the desk enters the living upon the Roll as it enters the dead, and strikes them through in the same motion.": "地下登记官在摊开的卷册下划线，随后起身；书库中每本锁链书都在各自保存的名字处翻开。绕桌而来的东西把活人登记进名册，如同登记死者，并在同一个动作中将名字划销。",
    "The First Warden rises from the plain dwarf-cut tomb at the gallery's head, its hands leaving the seal they were carved upon, and the lesser dead of the six tombs stand to attend the eldest of them. It measures you once against the chalked outline of the eighth, and finds the measure fair.": "第一守门人从长廊首端那座朴素矮人工艺墓中起身，双手离开原本雕刻其上的封印；六座墓里的次位亡者也站起，侍奉最古老的一位。它把你与第八座墓的粉笔轮廓比量一次，发现尺寸正合适。",
    "The Remembrancer draws its finger down the last open account and rings a small iron bell, and from the broken cells the debtors that filed their way out come dragging their sprung shackles to be counted. Every term it carried forward it calls in at once, and the sum of them it means to enter against you.": "记忆官以手指划过最后一笔未结账目，敲响小铁铃。债务人拖着挣开的镣铐，从破损牢房中走来接受清点。它把历来结转的每段刑期同时催缴，并打算将总额全记到你名下。",
    "The Turnkey sets its hand upon the counterweight's chain and lets the great block run to the foot of its arc, and the drum's count breaks for the first time since the goblin warren. What tends the works now tends them for the wound alone, and it will spend you upon the seal before it lets the water rise.": "司钥者把手搭上配重锁链，任巨大石块荡到弧线末端；自哥布林巢穴以来，鼓声计数第一次中断。如今维护工场之物只为那道伤口而维护；在容许水位上涨以前，它会先把你消耗在封印上。",
    "The Lich rises from the worn chair and does not reach for a working. He tells you plainly what the jar is: the lock upon the last door, and the last door at your back. He tells you that he is the last honest warden upon the Roll, who ended the warden before him as you have come to end him, and has kept the count alone since, feeding no name to the fire because he could not bring himself to feed the first. He asks you to keep it. Then he stands between you and the mantel, for you have not answered, and the servants' stair is behind you.": "巫妖从磨损座椅上起身，却没有伸手施法。他直截了当地告诉你罐子是什么：最后一扇门的锁，而那扇门就在你身后。他说自己是名册上最后一位诚实守门人；正如你前来终结他，他也曾终结前任，此后独自维持计数。他从未把任何名字投入火中，因为连第一个名字都不忍投入。他请求你继续守护。你没有回答，于是他站到你与壁炉架之间，而仆役阶梯就在身后。",
    "The Lich fights now as a man defends the one room he has, without heat and without hope, naming each seal upon the wall as its warden's stroke falls, six struck through in lead and the seventh whole. He puts himself between you and the jar to the last, and the last honest warden upon the Roll spends the strength of an age to keep a door he knows you mean to open.": "巫妖如今像一个守卫自己唯一房间的人那样战斗，没有怒火，也没有希望。每当守门人的攻击落下，他便念出墙上一道封印的名字：六道已经以铅划销，第七道仍然完整。他直到最后都挡在你与罐子之间；名册上最后一位诚实守门人耗尽一个时代积蓄的力量，守着一扇他明知你决意打开的门。"
  });
})();

// Boss phase transitions: the Maw-boar through the Speaker Beneath.
(() => {
  const target = globalThis.LOWMOOR_ZH_EXACT || (globalThis.LOWMOOR_ZH_EXACT = {});
  Object.assign(target, {
    "The boar backs into the den mouth, bleeding and unhurried, and lowers its head to teach the second lesson.": "野猪流着血，不慌不忙地退到巢穴入口，低下头来，准备教你第二堂课。",
    "Snik casts his crown into the dark and takes up a second spear. The king's business is finished; what remains is old, and cunning, and fights without an audience.": "斯尼克把王冠掷入黑暗，抄起第二支长矛。国王的事务已经结束；留下的是一个苍老而狡猾的战士，无需观众也会继续战斗。",
    "The Forewarden falls back upon the sealed door and sets his dead shoulders against it. In life the post was his, and in death he has yet to be relieved.": "前任守卫退到封印大门前，用亡者的双肩死死抵住。生前这岗位属于他，死后也仍未有人前来交接。",
    "The Reeve raises his cold signet, and the dead of three galleries stand to answer the summons. The session resumes, and the question before the court is you.": "执政官举起冰冷印戒，三条长廊中的死者应召起身。庭审恢复，而呈在法庭面前的问题正是你。",
    "The Celebrant closes his book beneath the water without haste and takes up the crook instead. The service is ended, and what follows is older than any service.": "司礼者在水下从容合起书卷，转而拿起牧杖。仪式已经结束，接下来发生的事情比任何仪式都更加古老。",
    "The hoard runs from the wyrm's shoulders in a ringing tide as Malgrith takes the air of the vault, and the first flame lights the dark from wall to wall.": "马尔格里斯腾入宝库空中，宝藏如鸣响的潮水从巨龙肩头倾落；第一道火焰随即照亮两墙之间的全部黑暗。",
    "Far above, wound thin through the roar of the fire, comes the creak of the Guild windlass turning, and Malgrith falters in the air at the sound of it. You take the opening the sound has bought you.": "遥远上方，行会绞盘转动的吱嘎声穿过烈火咆哮，细细传来。马尔格里斯听见声音，在空中一滞；你抓住这道声音为你换来的破绽。",
    "The Porter sets its stone staff across the threshold and takes the gate's own weight upon its shoulders. The toll of this gate is turning back the way you came, and you have declined to pay it.": "门房把石杖横在门槛上，用双肩扛起大门自身的重量。这道门收取的通行费，是沿来路折返，而你拒绝支付。",
    "Gnasha lifts Old Snik's crown from her brow and hangs it upon the throne-post with great care, as a worker hangs a coat. What rises from the throne fights for the stone below, and the stone is attending.": "格娜莎从额头摘下老斯尼克的王冠，小心挂上王座柱头，仿佛工人挂起外套。从王座上起身的存在将为下方石头而战，而石头正在倾听。",
    "The water stands up along her back as the Tarn-Mother rises, and the boom of it rolls through the galleries like a bell heard from inside the metal. The shallows were courtesy; what follows is the tarn itself.": "湖母起身时，水沿她背脊竖立，轰鸣滚过长廊，如同从钟体内部听见钟声。浅水只是她的礼让；接下来面对的才是山间湖本身。",
    "The Under-Gardener folds back its sleeves and puts down roots where it stands. The beds have been tended toward this hour for a hundred years, and every planted thing in the vault turns its cap toward you at once.": "地下园丁卷起衣袖，在站立之处扎下根系。菌床为这一刻照料了整整百年，宝库中每株栽种之物同时把菌盖转向你。",
    "The Procurer closes his ledger upon a ribbon and rings a small grey bell, once. From the dark of the road behind him his accounts come walking in to be settled, and every one of them is owed to the stone below.": "采办官用缎带夹住账页，合起账册，敲响灰色小铃，仅仅一下。它身后道路的黑暗中，一笔笔账目自行走来等待结算，而每一笔都欠给下方石头。",
    "The water peels back from the obelisk's root and the Speaker rises through it, older than the stone and patient past all reckoning. Every shard upon the field hums at one pitch, and the pitch is a word half said.": "水从方尖碑根部向两侧剥开，下方代言者从中升起；它比石头更加古老，耐心远超任何计量。原野每块碎片都以同一音高嗡鸣，而那音调是一个只说出一半的词。",
    "Far above, faint down twelve floors of dark, the Guild bell rings the hour upon the rim, and the Speaker's word breaks upon the sound of it. The hum of the shard-field falters, and you take the opening the bell has bought you.": "遥远上方，行会大钟在深渊边缘报时，钟声穿过十二层黑暗微弱传下。代言者的词在钟声上断裂，碎片原野的嗡鸣随之一滞；你抓住大钟为你换来的破绽。"
  });
})();

