    "The year's first grain is brought into Mereward, and by old custom the Guild weighs its own first take beside it. The town's standard weights come out of the moot-hall for the day, and every scale in the square is tried against them.": "本年度第一批谷物运进梅里沃德；依照旧俗，行会也把自己的第一笔收获放在旁边共同称量。当天，城镇标准砝码从议事厅取出，广场上的每一台秤都要与其校验。",
    "Every measure of lamp-oil sold in Mereward is tested against the sealed quart kept in the Guildhouse. A short measure is struck through in the ledger and its vessel broken upon the step, where the whole town may count them.": "梅里沃德出售的每份灯油都要与行会大厅封存的一夸脱标准量器比对。凡分量不足者都会在账册中划销，容器则砸碎在台阶上，任全城人数清点。",
    "Every mule, dog and pit-pony upon the Guild's strength is brought onto the green to be shod, dosed and entered in the stable-book. The hands who keep them draw their season's wage at the trestle in the same hour, in coin.": "行会名下的每头骡子、每条狗和每匹矿坑矮马都被带到草地，钉蹄、喂药，并登记进马厩簿。照料它们的人也在同一时辰到支架桌前领取本季工资，以钱币现付。",
