    "The hand passes through the harness as though the harness were the ghost of the two.": "那只手径直穿过挽具，仿佛两者之中，挽具才是幽灵。",
    "It peels off the unlit wall, takes the strength out of the arm, and keeps what it takes.": "它从没有光照的墙面剥离下来，抽走手臂的力量，并将夺走的一切据为己有。"
