    "It bites where the web has already held you, which is the whole craft of the thing.": "它专咬蛛网已经缠住你的地方，这便是那东西的全部狩猎技艺。",
    "The bite carries an elf's malice and a spider's chemistry, and the two go in together.": "这一咬同时带着精灵的恶意与蜘蛛的毒性，两者一并进入血肉。",
    "The cloud comes low along the floor, and what it touches goes numb from the fingers inward.": "毒云贴着地面低低涌来，凡被触及之处都从指端开始向内麻木。",
    "It strikes once, at the wrist, and the arm belongs to the venom from there down.": "它只在手腕刺了一下，从那里向下，整条手臂便归毒液支配。",
    "The tail comes over the coil and the sting goes in to the hilt of it.": "尾巴越过盘曲身躯猛然袭来，毒刺直没至根。",
    "The note goes on after the fungus is cut, standing in the ears like water.": "真菌被砍断后，鸣声仍未停止，如同积水滞留耳中。",
