    "The claw takes the forearm above the bracer, and the stiffness climbs from there.": "利爪抓住护腕上方的前臂，僵硬感从那里一路攀升。",
    "The reek arrives two rooms ahead of the claws, and the claws carry the same stiffness deeper.": "恶臭比利爪提前两个房间抵达，而利爪又把同样的僵硬带入更深处。",
