    "Tomorrow's Page, Read": "读懂明日之页",
    "The Draped Glass, Glimpsed": "瞥见蒙布之镜",
    "The Works' Orders, Read": "读懂工程命令",
    "The Master's Purpose, Heard": "听见主人的目的",
    "The Master's Fear, Heard": "听见主人的恐惧",
    "The Precedence, Read": "读懂尊卑次序",
    "The Manifest, Read": "读懂清单",
    "The Leak, Read": "读懂泄漏",
    "The Last Hand, Matched": "比对最后一人的笔迹",
    "The Miller's Hand": "磨坊主的笔迹",
    "The Abbey's Hand": "修道院的笔迹",
