    "(menu) with full honours and endow every chronicle after; achievements are kept either way. Either road is entered in the same ledger.": "（菜单）载誉退休，为之后每份编年史提供捐助；无论选择哪条路，成就都会保留，两者也登记在同一本账簿。",
