    ", six halls charted at about two days all told, ending upon the observatory of the mage Vastian at the bottom. Adventurers of the 5th rank may instead": "，已绘制六座厅堂，全程预计约需两天，终点是法师瓦斯蒂安位于底部的观测台。第五阶位的冒险者也可以改为",
    "The post-game is posted plainly at the counter. Below the last stair the": "通关后内容已清楚张贴在商店。最后一道阶梯下方，",
    "now sits, a season at a time. The first twelve seasons of a chronicle pay one prestige point apiece, and the rate thins after them until you retire. Adventurers of the 5th rank may instead": "如今驻守在那里，每次维持一个赛季。每份编年史最初十二个赛季各奖励一点声望，此后奖励会逐步减半，直至退休。第五阶位的冒险者也可以改为",
